    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000t1q7](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000t1q7) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jul 19 2026 3km NW of Chupaca. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -12.0429 longitude -75.3013. It impacted 93228 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
